<title>BELGIUM: BBL CUTS BANK SAVINGS BOND RATES.</title>
<headline>BBL CUTS BANK SAVINGS BOND RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles Lambert</p>
<p>SA said on Wednesday it would cut interest rates on</p>
<p>bank savings certificates from Thursday, February 20.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    three years     3.50 pct	3.65</p>
<p>    five years	4.30 pct	4.60</p>
<p>NOTE - The move is in line with announcements by Belgium's</p>
<p>other main banks.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
